+From 6a8b2843894f123a11b800ed985b56d4ef771ddb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Fil Dunsky <filipp.dunsky@gmail.com>
+Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 21:15:27 +0300
+Subject: [PATCH] board: mediatek: add Teralink TL3020 256mb
+
+Add U-Boot support for the Teralink TL3020 256mb (256 MiB SPI-NAND):
+defconfig, device tree and default environment.
+
+Signed-off-by: Fil Dunsky <filipp.dunsky@gmail.com>
+---
+--- /dev/null
++++ b/configs/mt7981_teralink_tl3020-256mb_defconfig
+@@ -0,0 +1,112 @@
